{"id":"6afd79be-45d4-83ee-bcda-066079974065","sections":[{"bodySize":846,"controls":{"checkbox":0,"fields":0,"radio":20,"reveal":0,"submit":1,"textarea":0},"count":5,"heading":"九、本章綜合習題","html":"<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">共 5 題｜理解與應用｜先不附解答</p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">以下題目難度略高於前面的理解檢查，重點是整合檢測原理與分析證據。</p>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 4);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 1 題｜水質的綜合判斷</p>某河川下游的濁度與導電度均明顯增加，但 pH 幾乎不變。下列何者最合理？<div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"A-_r_et_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"A\" id=\"A-_r_et_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. pH 不變表示水質完全沒有變化</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"B-_r_ev_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"B\" id=\"B-_r_ev_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>B. 濁度增加必然造成導電度上升</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"C-_r_f1_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"C\" id=\"C-_r_f1_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. 懸浮顆粒與溶解離子的情況可能同時發生變化</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"D-_r_f3_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"D\" id=\"D-_r_f3_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. 可確定重金屬污染是唯一原因</label></div></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 2 題｜溶氧與有機污染</p>兩處河段水溫相近，A 的 DO 為 7.5 mg/L、BOD₅ 為 2 mg/L；B 的 DO 為 3.0 mg/L、BOD₅ 為 10 mg/L。下列何者最合理？<div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"A-_r_f6_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"A\" id=\"A-_r_f6_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. B 河段可能有較高的可生物分解污染負荷</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"B-_r_f8_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"B\" id=\"B-_r_f8_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>B. B 河段的溶氧量比 A 高</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"C-_r_fa_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"C\" id=\"C-_r_fa_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. BOD₅ 就是目前水中含有的氧氣</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"D-_r_fc_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"D\" id=\"D-_r_fc_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. 可直接證明 B 河段沒有任何生物活動</label></div></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 3 題｜微粒質量濃度</p>某採樣器抽取 12 m³ 空氣，經過粒徑篩選後，濾紙增加 360 µg。此批樣品中被收集微粒的平均質量濃度為多少？<div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"A-_r_ff_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"A\" id=\"A-_r_ff_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. 3 µg/m³</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"B-_r_fh_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"B\" id=\"B-_r_fh_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>B. 30 µg/m³</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"C-_r_fj_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"C\" id=\"C-_r_fj_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. 360 µg/m³</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"D-_r_fl_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"D\" id=\"D-_r_fl_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. 4320 µg/m³</label></div></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 4 題｜光學檢測的限制</p>某種光學 PM2.5 感測器在潮濕環境中讀值偏高，但精密質量法測得的濃度沒有相同比例上升。最合理的解釋是？<div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"A-_r_fo_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"A\" id=\"A-_r_fo_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. PM2.5 一定具有強烈的放射性</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"B-_r_fq_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"B\" id=\"B-_r_fq_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>B. 光學儀器不需要校正</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"C-_r_fs_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"C\" id=\"C-_r_fs_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. 所有微粒都會完全吸收光線</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"D-_r_fu_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"D\" id=\"D-_r_fu_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. 濕度改變微粒的光學散射特性，可能影響推估結果</label></div></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 5 題｜環境監測的推論</p>某地區設置污染防治設備後，監測到 SO₂ 濃度下降。若要判斷是否由設備造成，還應考慮什麼？<div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"A-_r_g1_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"A\" id=\"A-_r_g1_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. 只需比較兩次測量，無須考慮其他因素</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"B-_r_g3_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"B\" id=\"B-_r_g3_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>B. 只要污染物下降就能確定因果關係</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"C-_r_g5_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"C\" id=\"C-_r_g5_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. 需要考慮排放量、氣象條件與較長期的數據</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"D-_r_g7_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"D\" id=\"D-_r_g7_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. 只需測量同時期 PM2.5 的顏色</label></div></div></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">已作答 0 / 5 題</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"solid\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">批改習題</span></button></div></div>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">這一章的學習目標，不是記住最多檢測儀器名稱，而是能看到一個環境問題後，判斷<span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">應該測量什麼、為什麼這種方法測得出來，以及數據究竟能支持哪些結論</strong></span>。這也是面對高中講義題與實際環境監測資料時最有用的能力。</p>","messageId":"0f16d869-dbcb-46d1-a19d-66bcb8787b57","numbered":["1","2","3","4","5"],"progress":[]}]}